Privacy Policy — Video Merger, Joiner & Collage (VideoMerge Pro)
Effective date: June 8, 2026

Nageshwar Rao ("we", "us", or "our") built the Video Merger, Joiner & Collage app ("the App"). This Privacy Policy explains how the App handles your information. Your privacy is our priority: the App does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

Summary

We do not collect any personal information.
We do not require an account or sign‑up.
The App works fully offline and does not request internet access, so your files never leave your device.
All video and audio processing happens locally on your device.
We do not show ads or use analytics or tracking.
Information We Collect
None. We do not collect, transmit, or store any personal or usage data. We have no servers that receive your data.

Access to Your Media (Videos/Audio)
To let you merge and edit videos, the App needs permission to access the media you choose:

Videos & Audio (READ_MEDIA_VIDEO, READ_MEDIA_AUDIO, and READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE on older devices): used only to let you select the videos and music you want to merge or edit, and to save the videos you create back to your device. These files are processed entirely on your device and are never uploaded or shared.
Notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS): used only to show processing progress. You can disable notifications anytime in your device settings.
The App only accesses the specific files you select. Output videos are saved to your device's storage (e.g., the Movies/VideoMerge Pro folder) and remain under your control.

How Your Data Is Used
The media you select is used solely to perform the editing actions you request (merge, join, collage, trim, compress, convert, add music, etc.) on your device. We do not analyze, copy, transmit, or retain your content.

Data Sharing and Disclosure
We do not sell, trade, or transfer any data to outside parties. Because the App does not collect data, there is nothing to share. If you share a video you created using your device's share feature, that action is initiated by you and governed by the privacy policy of the destination app or service.

Third‑Party Services
The App uses open‑source libraries (such as FFmpeg and AndroidX/Jetpack components) to perform on‑device media processing. These run locally and do not collect or transmit your personal information. The App contains no advertising SDKs and no analytics SDKs.

Data Security
Because all processing happens locally and no data is transmitted off your device, your content stays on your device under the protection of your device's own security.

Children's Privacy
The App does not knowingly collect any personal information from anyone, including children under 13. It is safe for general audiences.

Your Rights and Choices
You can revoke the App's media or notification permissions anytime in your device's Settings. You can delete videos you created from within the App or your device's file manager. Uninstalling the App removes it and its app‑specific data.

Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.
